n Monsallier","role":"Cadavre Route"},{"id":1934145,"name":"Guilhaine Chambon","role":"Cadavre Enfer"},{"id":1946335,"name":"Xavier Bonastre","role":"Cadavre Enfer","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4ZFiCXbwKg7jEphxXVHFeTIEv1b.jpg"},{"id":6279738,"name":"Lorenzo Farnetani","role":"Cadavre Enfer"},{"id":4175371,"name":"Francesca Domenichini","role":"Cadavre Enfer"},{"id":6279741,"name":"Christophe Legouix","role":"Cadavre Enfer"},{"id":6279742,"name":"Gabriel Greffier","role":"Cadavre Enfer"},{"id":5023979,"name":"Gilles Elsensohn","role":"Cadavre Enfer"},{"id":6279746,"name":"Thomas Aunay","role":"Cadavre Enfer"},{"id":6279748,"name":"Baptiste Harbuz","role":"Cadavre Enfer"},{"id":235198,"name":"Sebastian Barrio","role":"Cadavre Enfer","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dawZjewkjWMRGX7cszwNlpmVaiF.jpg"},{"id":6279749,"name":"Ugo Munoz","role":"Cadavre Enfer"},{"id":2847757,"name":"Gérard Bertin","role":"Cadavre Enfer"},{"id":6279750,"name":"François Chaumette","role":"Cadavre Enfer"},{"id":6279751,"name":"Brigitte Poincelin","role":"Cadavre Enfer"},{"id":6279752,"name":"Jérôme Côme","role":"Cadavre Enfer"},{"id":6279753,"name":"Tristan Ordas","role":"Cadavre Enfer"},{"id":6279754,"name":"Théo Lafosse","role":"Cadavre Enfer"},{"id":6279755,"name":"Vincent Coppin","role":"Cadavre Enfer"},{"id":6279756,"name":"Fabien Gauthier","role":"Cadavre Enfer"},{"id":6279757,"name":"Faycal Beykrar","role":"Cadavre Enfer"},{"id":3359005,"name":"Catherine Raiser Duchamp","role":"Psychologue 1"},{"id":3307388,"name":"Camille Bechon","role":"Psychologue 2"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"In seguito a un incidente stradale, un misterioso personaggio di nome Nathan cerca di sfuggire al suo tragico destino. Ad aiutarlo ad accettare questo destino c'è Daniel, il motociclista che ha causato l'incidente e che si rivela una sorta di guida per l'aldilà. Di fronte alla dura realtà del giudizio universale, le loro azioni vengono esaminate e soppesate sulla bilancia del bene e del male. Sfortunatamente per loro, la bilancia li dirige verso le porte dell'inferno."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Nathan and Daniel are caught in a road accident that kills them both. As they come to grips with their deaths, Nathan confronts his past and the consequences of his actions. Now trapped in the hellish void of Pandemonium, he encounters tortured souls like Jeanne, a disturbed child; Julia, a grief-stricken mother; and Norghul, the guide of the great void. Will he find a way to escape the torment that awaits him for eternity?","tagline":"Hell knows no forgiveness."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Deux inconnus, Nathan et Daniel, sortent vraisemblablement indemnes d'un violent accident de voiture au bord d'une route de montagne isolée. Quand la réalité de leur situation se révèle et que le ton monte, deux étranges portes apparaissent au beau milieu de la route, chacune offrant un destin opposé. Tryptique sur l'exploration de la culpabilité et de la punition, qui ne s'épargne pas de montrer les face les plus sombres de l'humanité."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/apmsjUBEtwJLXEXGmwTLwYsjKf8.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/apmsjUBEtwJLXEXGmwTLwYsjKf8.png","language":"en","width":1536,"height":441},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fgShstWmeUCyTsvZqzT3K7b6VW5.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fgShstWmeUCyTsvZqzT3K7b6VW5.png","language":"en","width":4319,"height":942},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jSKbsrtMDcu4yxFMo48AssBsR4c.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jSKbsrtMDcu4yxFMo48AssBsR4c.png","language":"en","width":4319,"height":942}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9B7kKpmhwZH9Q9wJWSR3xpWBI5o.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9B7kKpmhwZH9Q9wJWSR3xpWBI5o.jpg","lang